// once ("The floor is hot under your claws: lava below. Dig beside it to look first."), however shallow the
// lava; the mole never sinks into it. (Seed 9 dug straight down into lava ~37 m deep within 12 s before.)
map
BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB
B............................B
B............................B
B............................B
B............................B
B............................B
B.......@....................B
BrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrB
BrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrB
BrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrB
B###llllllllll###############B
B###llllllllll###############B
B###llllllllll###############B
B###llllllllll###############B
BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB
